    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create a short abandoned-cart recovery email.\n\nUse ONLY these exact values:\nCustomer: {{ $json.Customer }}\nProduct: {{ $json.Product }}\nCart Value: ₱{{ $json[\"Cart Value\"] }}\n\nRules:\n- Never describe the product with adjectives such as popular, best-selling, great, amazing, new, stylish, or similar.\n- Never invent product features, benefits, discounts, promotions, shipping offers, links, or other information.\n- Mention the exact product name and exact cart value.\n- Address the customer by their first name.\n- Keep the email under 70 words.\n- Be friendly, professional, and not pushy.\n- Encourage the customer to return to their cart.\n- Do not repeat the cart value unnecessarily.\n- Do not use placeholders.\n- Output ONLY the subject and email.\n\nFormat:\n\nSubject: [short subject]\n\nHi [Customer],\n\n[email body]\n\nBest regards,\nCustomer Support",
